# ---- owner email on a red production deploy (hub only, BH-8894) ----
# bin/vercel-deploy-snapshot.sh emails the project owner through Resend when a
# project's newest production deploy turns red. The API key lives here, in the
# hub's global.env, and never in a settings row. Unset = no email is sent and
# the log says `owner-mail <p> not-configured`; the page still goes out. The
# sender is the settings row lib.owner-mail.owner_mail_from (empty = off).
#RESEND_API_KEY=<resend-api-key>
